  type_object_err_parent_main.pcpp - break step of type_object.pcpp:
  parent in the main block: parent is a method's (SM0011)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\type_object_err_parent_main.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\type_object_err_parent_main.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
